<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson in GSM deal with Norway's Telenor Invest.</title>
<headline>Ericsson in GSM deal with Norway's Telenor Invest.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms group Ericsson said on Monday it had signed an agreement with Norwegian telephone operator Telenor Invest about delivery of a GSM system for Bangladesh.</p>
</text>
